  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "建房与恢复",
      "items": [
        "pages/index.server.ts 从游戏注册表取游戏目录。进入 /games/mahjong 后，mahjong.server.ts 从玩法注册表取卡片。",
        "RoomObject.create() 按请求装配游戏，直接调用 Room.create() 检查持久化冲突并确定玩法版本。",
        "join() 恢复会话后调用 Room.join()。收到 resume 后，Room.resume() 校验凭证，DO 绑定座位。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "快照与确认",
      "items": [
        "snapshotFor(seat) 经 Room.viewFor()、engine.viewFor() 和 rules.viewFor() 生成视图。",
        "Room.command() 完成保存和推送后返回 ack，由 webSocketMessage() 发给发起者。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Alarm 超时入口",
      "items": [
        "RoomObject.alarm() → restoreRoom() → Room.tick() → advanceTime()。",
        "到期时调用 engine.apply({ timeout: true })，随后沿 Room.commit() 路径保存并推送。"
      ]
    }
  ]
